      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPACE INVADER (3) turned spotting a big start finishing sixth (23.25) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Has ability and looks hard to stop. NO CHARGE (7) has been out of the placings the last couple but was a Grade 5 winner (23.06) three back at this track. Well placed here and can atone this time. INVICTUS HARMONY (8) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 7th at Healesville following on from a second place finish (23.10) at this track the start prior. Has ability and is one of the better chances. MINTER SCORCH (4) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
